      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d780ae1da5a986b12f70681",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c06a2f0c3853f2806a3b65c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "展现绝对的实力吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c89fd2ee90d39bf8f727aff4c735e85e290a905a3883fac3b11bbb13da5ad68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "800000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:407d6771fe2491ec3cb82c27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "互相切磋吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f0f69dbe025c17c5f0d64c121ea22c588e689c22bd963b921545360003d7cd6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:959436d7f9a6f1644098b095",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小试身手就到此为止。\r\n正式开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1664a2ba40233c3f7102f761a9f9fabae32997872ed470e41293fe6e741a98da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fa5df08b572acc4790066ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安，训练员君。\r\n今天也要专心奋斗，\r\n所以我们开始准备训练吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c9f048b7ad8302aa3816108f1f23e1a38f880ce568c5b41f3145200017420a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f24bdf70a19b5aaabb8b5837",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目标是登上赛马娘的顶点……\r\n今天也要全力以赴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e61cd91c1402762df18684f7b720d9f150de439522ac4d5b8ec8168525fcd3be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:643520c7ad7a21b60db4f436",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经下午了……时间有限，\r\n迅速果断地展开行动吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92e89fab420ee37ff13c1bd47a2e4ffbb3678dfa9edc5d190eca6ad9b77b664a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e183b60f88d0029fb89b5a51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在上午就把\r\n学生会的工作处理完了。\r\n现在可以专心投入训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "306d0d1ee6804f348134f64f0305de26ca92d17d0cfc936b182f45a6f96b3d95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab00698e044c5df6a7b6f255",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天色已经完全转暗了呢，\r\n但这并不代表今天已经结束。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b459fcf65c96789d805c19576c7892759e45ce85394b8c7093204ed4ab6829dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22953b0f297b21091da485ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上好，训练员君。\r\n到这个时间或许会开始感到疲累，\r\n只要再努力一下就结束了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "085272299f2bda46d4b57b626ab5b837701f741b490be376a2d5805d71b6496d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:310160bbcaead9867cebc726",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经到了后辈们\r\n要开始出道的时期，\r\n我希望她们都能跑出好成绩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c217b6e6a3e1ee9af897f78d87b40bf90babf19571ddfdfd0a548c6a5b2ab557",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f334595579d744f98a3d1fb1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帝王她很亢奋地说\r\n要请我吃冰……\r\n呵呵，得为她空出时间才行呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b2e750d889f8b453eb130ac571f1db16ad6416a4688bf0820fd0d0be52ca492",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6196830bc89f9f6560a02b7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天的时候我一定都会赏月，\r\n也许我是憧憬着夜空中的明月\r\n那种闪耀动人的存在吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24f8cbb77e61111f627b8576abc283faf681b41433ebd36e27e58de3f91d931a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:406322b52d88aebc91f44679",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到了这个时期赛道上有时会积雪，\r\n所以学生会必须\r\n更加致力于整备工作。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3271de7516c816f8e98de5ba84fe4b8657b247a9d5c78e4e01e113c42d5ba608",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d84411de9427774af9688476",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛也跟武道一样，\r\n要「始于礼，终于礼」吧……所以，\r\n训练员，今天也要请你多多指教了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "114a6fd709d25ae6f29601bc6ea845e794d3f12be95428c789f58dd6a7327d67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6dc49b7d3541233f823d868",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天早上散步时，有个太太\r\n称赞我服装的花纹很漂亮呢。\r\n然后还给了我好吃的糖果喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "231f7c902bb08e4120d7d1eda88898650ec92398d875a0b2ca8d841375ed694b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20cd22c9e84dabb79230bbfc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "抱持着正射必中的精神，\r\n真诚地持续创造每一天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5c3d3fe9d8e6905f9c546d55f94c1bfa6bf1f3d96a031107930013208e82b4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2793f0aa85f137990b9b250",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下一个例行节日是……嗯。\r\n趁天还亮着先联络\r\n负责的人吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "912a8bccdaa013151d3217a51263f13176e71d47496dd7581f9b61930f3cd848",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35f9967bc7de8e368ec4cccf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黑暗会吸引妖魔……\r\n至少得做好准备，\r\n才能在出事时实时应对。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e94f3532dedd1ac8118a8f69d8bc489b2b9ef216da087394e9740261da031e94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f67d891a678852cbbfad61ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的个性是越想着该睡了，\r\n就越睡不着的类型。\r\n……祭典前一晚折腾了很久呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4e33242826558553c1f04f3325189a15089d2032554f803259abff3fae126da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c448d61863f71550cdd7be15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……呼。这时期的睡魔\r\n是射箭也无法驱走的强敌啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a4fb66ba616a135929817e8060b29516eaffdc55b59488ebaba03212a3d8740",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7237dc71205cfec224383234",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "或许要在遥远的将来，我才能\r\n打从心底沉静下来……但如果我们\r\n都有时间的话，就一起去祭典吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "538690f4742c07fcd0640fa2a790ff44775a2cc43f0f83c5fd01795ef009ac1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b31c8c294056734365599483",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "菊花和秋之华，还有盾形奖牌……\r\n不，目标是追求更高的王冠啊。\r\n好了，好好享受「祭典」吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5fd57547d6f9af552f2e174c40c213118531fbd48b2a392782734fd40ea4baf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6d2d053fe3948c41d6293a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟外面相比，这里的温度适中。\r\n你最好也暖和一下身体。\r\n……就像我也正在这么做呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82504b67e968f406617950bd1efbb736f1e75dc64fb4d85ced1b359bdbb55616",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b460d246ac60d8e64b77636b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44549cabe2b0babde37a7a75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef5b4fece4d3a2438411d81a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你也来杯咖啡如何。\r\n让我请你喝杯特别的深焙咖啡。\r\n……这可是起死回生的，特效药呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f2f5bae43461b7b128efedef1b3b3d71b7d0e417c124f5133c2c19aa1e375a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4339a52cd40a5c67b6bee2f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "沐浴晨光，焕然一新……原本\r\n想要如此，不过对如今的我来说\r\n或许有些太耀眼了。呵呵……",
      "source_fingerprint": "408c4c8122e2cc04e4b9eca5bfa722b00764ccd2779528c6daeacc2922b43540",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b418cea3544a448bcfbbc5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的便当有胡萝卜饭和\r\n紫薯可乐饼……啊，对了。\r\n我试着准备了色彩丰富的菜肴",
      "source_fingerprint": "8700fd51acd88f5644fb055ed3ed099aa4f344060b15ab79fad0011f0f63671e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:288297d262fd25025ecef521",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在要去学生会室。我想第一个\r\n到达……气槽似乎也这么想。\r\n我们正悄悄较着劲呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e9ac3e6144eb7e77f18a8ee7fb0da263dbfe0353697a887382bab5fdd5d62ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0b47bf81d5b14552d4494cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我正在巡逻。\r\n为了让大家在这静谧的黑暗中，\r\n度过安宁的时光……呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59a0c1a7fdb8125de5d52b9f1196d15ced51585ec6bc367f2a0f37c020e64cc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a52e698ab2219eb39ff71364",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听着王牌的故事不知不觉就\r\n到了晚上。十分有趣。\r\n说的是在诡异之地的奇妙经历",
      "source_fingerprint": "958ed9ce019d875ce3faae100da5b6f414376da5ed8f34a48e5f505362211f56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54540a7ae0c75d40f021cdc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "或许因为春天到了，大家都热衷于\r\n聊往事。我也想和老友叙旧\r\n……不过高峰她们可没那么好说话",
      "source_fingerprint": "87671304141a458357f7dd70944181f40531c6f6145abbba17cba18e0dc29221",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0b8518110ae1bf95696afba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "完全不热，我可不会这么说……\r\n但我希望能配得上这身\r\n威严的装束，保持自律。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0f0757f108204a6e92ccad82ff18a68a493a36cb74597f029876da8734866be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d208e9c00691e26fb4ca22b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢装扮。幻想着在不同的世界\r\n成为不同的自己……这样的\r\n时光，也十分令人心动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b99bab38d806d2045a21dc704b8ce12dad68b161f0580243394a64389089e4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f6e583daf80d80df869bc87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "前些天举办的『特雷森学园\r\n日常趣事歌牌大赛』，颇受\r\n好评。那么下一个活动是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "236670ab0ade8cd9df0b5a6e91fce76c6f65e635d15138f2735355ac5cb14e0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:030d67b23275b05273e19dbb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4801f31043217604704f981d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "气槽她帮了我不少忙。\r\n学生会能顺利运作也是\r\n多亏了她的努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3e4f85644059d95c6443eb503b4c0e814ad379fc38bb1d3816441c344e07cc7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cb4af4d1d1fe09a554191c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学生会经常会收到来自学生的烦恼。\r\n嗯……看来午餐又有品项缺货了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf026975a3a9dfa89920b1b60daed610325f96b2a91006cd79f20e5a5dd5ba18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0b7a353cf1dff991998cdc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵……\r\n「没姜就只好将就一下」……\r\n……呵呵呵呵……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf7b5275611b48673f1f7966d24fc5ecf287655ef8137f74d494226d8bafd9f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ac2388fb55ea4495a0606f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然想要取胜，就必须想好\r\n自己希望以什么样的方式取胜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6c4a8b8b8e9f120d845670573e21ecbc3115bc9a87cb81cbe29b11958b2f23e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bb0888750ac8fd9c1433402",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然有很多性格独特的学生，但对于\r\n赛跑大家都是很认真的。希望……\r\n她们的目标、梦想都能实现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66bf71949cbfad15479fab75a2ddd10c079405a00f46d8cc32750796f14deced",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:585bce7c7bba0d82b1f48d4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当然，胜者舞台的表现上\r\n我也是以顶点为目标的。\r\n要把最好的演唱会献给粉丝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9be8cc06481eb76f429296c818c129cb444e6942edb66b5d7bed908078b858e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f119b7b636d90ffb2fc94e1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套服装也是很多学生的憧憬。\r\n我会在演唱会上全力以赴，\r\n做好大家的榜样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "630dbb4567a14a64a912f8eb52a6929c07fba9fbf6f42e56b86697bb2fbfc314",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59d4d3da5c11f774cd1882eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着决胜服时就会充满斗志。\r\n那就像是从「学生会长」\r\n切换成「皇帝」的感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3678c67f4ae8113622000315c35a5ea681a54b0064a9372b8401b95a0592b8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84536ddbde2c22941010e951",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在迈向顶点的道路上，\r\n随时都有这套决胜服的陪伴。\r\n它是我无可取代的东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f79231dd6692da7f9bd45cb60195419cdb97382373c71d02292e74565ddbd80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dba6f96f942a0ded10835403",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到大家晨练时的样子，\r\n会让我也充满干劲。\r\n因此晨练是不可或缺的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8de5b9f1180e0dc46f0d051b0121166f56065dc8b7d27bf7278705fcd0c05891",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "91009"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
